# PlanningWorkspace - Repository Reference

## Quick Reference: Which Repo?

| Task | Repo | Start Here |
|------|------|------------|
| Add API endpoint | NextGenOrig | Find existing endpoint in same feature area |
| Add database query | NextGenOrig | Find existing DataProvider in same feature |
| Add UI page/component | Gateway.Web / CustomerEngagement.Web / ClientPortal.Sidecar.Web | Find similar page in Features folder |
| Add HTTP client method | NextGenOrig (defines), Blazor apps (consume) | Find existing method in ApiHttpClient |

