## NuGet Dependencies

Packages come from remote feeds only. No local package workflow.

If work requires NuGet package changes:
1. Document in Discussion
2. Wait for package publish
3. Update references and continue

**UI Stubbing:** If UI depends on pending package changes, create stubs marked with `// TODO: Remove stub when [PackageName] published`. DON'T STUB if its not necessary.
